3)^{4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3{e}^{0},\\sqrt{9},{2}^{4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,3,16⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the value of $f(t)$ at $t=5$ is the vector $⟨3,3,16⟩.$" 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186087665 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278286 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186087665 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278287 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186087665 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278288 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186087756 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278268 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186087757 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278264 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186087758 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278263 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186087792 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278198 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186087852 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278261 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186087853 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278262 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092229 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278335 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092229 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278336 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092229 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278337 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092229 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278338 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092229 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278339 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092230 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278289 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092230 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278290 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092230 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278291 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092230 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278292 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092230 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278326 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092230 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278327 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092231 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278270 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092232 1038 #edb/ref 17592186278271 13194139533404 17592186045585 true] [17592186092232 1038 #edb/ref 1759218